  "description": "This YITAMOTOR mirror was engineered to look, fit and function like the original mirror assembly for your vehicle's specific year, make, and model. Upgrade to our high-quality towing mirror today and enjoy a safer, more enjoyable driving experience.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado pickups all models\n2003-2006 GMC Sierra pickups all models\n2003-2006 Chevy Suburban Avalanche Tahoe\n2003-2006 GMC Yukon/Yukon XL 1500/2500\n2003-2006 Cadillac Escalade ESV/EXT\n2007 Chevy Silverado classic models\n2007 GMC Sierra classic models\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nQuality Glass Design\nThese towing mirrors are with adjustable upper plane glass and manually adjusted blind-spot convex mirrors, providing you with a better and wider rear view.\nHeated Upper Plane Glass\nThe upper plane glass of these mirrors is heated for defogging and defrosting. It can defog and defrost by itself, super convenient for you on a rainy or foggy day.\nDurable and Safe\nMade from high-quality materials, our rearview mirror is durable and built to withstand impacts and resist shattering, providing added safety in the event of an accident.\nManual Telescoping Function\nThese mirrors can be manually extended so you can have a wider and better rear view. You can also fold them in tight places.\nAluminum Triangle Base\nThese tow mirrors can be stably installed on your vehicle as they adopt classic triangle construction, durable aluminum base, and pre-installed studs.",
